@startuml
title Activity - UC-09 Placement Test [PROPOSED / NOT IMPLEMENTED]
skinparam shadowing false
start
:Authenticate new learner;
:Load versioned placement questions;
while (Question remains?) is (yes)
  :Render using exercise engine;
  :Validate and record answer in test state;
endwhile (no)
if (Enough valid answers?) then (yes)
  :Calculate deterministic score;
  :Map score to CEFR with tie-breaking policy;
  :Find published Course.cefr match;
  :Show level and course recommendation;
else (no)
  :Offer default course / skip path;
endif
note right
  Persistence, API and RLS are not locked.
  Implementation requires a separate plan.
end note
stop
@enduml
